{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"紧绷的肩膀终于松开，胸腔打开\",\"source\":\"像一直微微绷着肩膀的人，终于长长呼出一口气，胸腔一下打开。\",\"type\":6,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿用一个人的身体状态比喻音乐带来的舒展，屏幕稿将这个比喻并入人物叙述，变成了他实际发生的身体动作。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"久悬的期待终于得到回应\",\"source\":\"若还记得第32小节那次差一点抵达、却没能真正落定的高潮，这里又可以听出另一层：前面悬置已久的期待，终于得到了某种满足。\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将其作为一种可选择的听法，屏幕稿却把这种解释写成了确定发生的结果。\"},{\"sec\":\"S14\",\"screen\":\"尾声从远处回应开头；末尾和弦接住悬着的话\",\"source\":\"尾声似乎还在与全曲开头隔空说话；熟悉的声响像隔着很远应了一声；最后那几下向上抬起的和弦，又像接住开头悬着的话。\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿用「似乎」「像」保留了听感解释的不确定性，屏幕稿去掉这些限定，变成了确定的音乐关系。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8f289b65-2680-4c81-90e9-eb4bb37e961f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T032949323513Z", "elapsed_seconds": 166.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T03:32:36.006460+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6f51582be5744471d1e777c1ad44a059650cda8ee5b8f0b61863c3645f4104c5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd